tps://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619174_620033421121701_1237260395774015338_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LereOeY9dXAQ7kNvwHDOsAS&_nc_oc=Ado9uaY5cTOBiHJ0VaRfddGBahylq9rrBptCSjgUY5u8VBOLvTnhJnwfhAZSdg-N7FU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK4ryJMu2BIdQJQXYwHMJcPWYwTwh3HbaEdlfKSfpgklw&oe=6AA6B75B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560_1440.png", "id": "1412451040495807", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618288_1412451043829140_3172190558726510506_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7s7oaXnHYJEQ7kNvwFxFyyr&_nc_oc=Adp1W32ec8CzJJe4iQbuMyJCey-A8psl1_bG1D1LDf2d_fF_Orfcuid-V8UsLj18K3s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIPaXlrQeb3pVmFVtYwluxjcrTEO2qnbF2Hy3XMoU5A4g&oe=6AA69251"}, "display_name": "Skybound Legacy", "keywords": ["Rollercoaster", "ImmersiveVRride", "Virtualrollercoaster", "ThemeparkVR", "FantasycoasterVR"], "long_description": "Welcome to Skybound Legacy! Prepare for a high-speed, heart-pounding rollercoaster experience through a meticulously crafted, classic old village.\n\nStrap in for a visually stunning journey that whips past quaint half-timbered houses, over cobblestone bridges, and through the vibrant town square. The village is teeming with life: friendly birds flutter past your head, and curious animals watch you zip by.\n\nThis isn't just about speed; it's about pure, engaging visual charm. Every twist, turn, and drop is synchronized to reveal breathtaking scenes of the peaceful countryside. Skybound Legacy: Village Run offers a fluid, captivating ride that is both intensely thrilling and wonderfully immersive, making it the perfect blend of speed and enchantment.", "short_description": "Experience a thrilling VR rollercoaster through a magical kingdom."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://xrexarplay-cloud.github.io/SkyboundLegacy-privacy-po